message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived release."
title: "Smart-Contract LLM Reliability Benchmark"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-09-10
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Thi-Thu-HuongLe/smart-contract-llm-reliability"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible software for failure-visible evaluation of frozen code language
  models on SmartBugs-Curated, ScrawlD, and BCCC, including structured-output
  validation, selective recovery, benchmark evaluation, robustness analyses,
  and cross-fitted taxonomy-aware calibration.
